{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sf39f07812f074cea","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-620e294df3cb9ab7ada4","text":"这地方光秃秃的，简直一点也不美观嗡…所有柱子上都该有一盏灯才对嗡！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-a5fdeb8683b9d24ae7cd","text":"为了拯救房间的布局，我不介意亲自做灯——我要追求极致嗡！","speaker":""}]}
